<idea-plugin>
    <id>jp.lunaproject.layoutmanager</id>
    <name>Layout Manager</name>
    <vendor>Luna Project</vendor>

    <description><![CDATA[
    <p>Brings named tool window layouts to JetBrains Rider, like <b>Window | Layouts</b> in other JetBrains IDEs.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Save the current tool window layout under a name and switch between layouts at any time.</li>
      <li>Keep layouts shared by all solutions or specific to one solution.</li>
      <li>Restore the active layout, save changes into it, rename or delete layouts, or go back to the default layout.</li>
      <li>Reopen each solution with the tool window layout it had when it was closed.</li>
      <li>Rider's <b>Window | Layout Settings</b> is integrated into the layout menu (optional).</li>
      <li>Prefer the menu of other JetBrains IDEs? Switch to it in the settings.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Find the actions under <b>Window | Layouts</b> and the options under <b>Settings | Tools | Layout Manager</b>.
    The user interface is available in English and Japanese.</p>
    <hr/>
    <p>JetBrains Rider に、他の JetBrains IDE の <b>ウィンドウ | レイアウト</b> と同様の、名前付きツールウィンドウレイアウトを追加します。</p>
    <ul>
      <li>現在のツールウィンドウのレイアウトに名前を付けて保存し、いつでも切り替えられます。</li>
      <li>レイアウトは、すべてのソリューションで共通にするか、ソリューションごとに保存するかを選べます。</li>
      <li>使用中のレイアウトの復元、変更の保存、名前の変更、削除、デフォルトのレイアウトへの切り替えができます。</li>
      <li>ソリューションを開くと、前回閉じたときのレイアウトを復元します。</li>
      <li>Rider の <b>ウィンドウ | レイアウト設定</b> をレイアウトメニューに統合します (オプション)。</li>
      <li>他の JetBrains IDE と同じメニューを使いたい場合は、設定で切り替えられます。</li>
    </ul>
    <p>操作は <b>ウィンドウ | レイアウト</b>、設定は <b>設定 | ツール | Layout Manager</b> にあります。英語と日本語の表示に対応しています。</p>
    ]]></description>

    <change-notes><![CDATA[
    <h3>1.0.0</h3>
    <p>First public release.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Named tool window layouts, shared by all solutions or specific to one solution.</li>
      <li>Restore, save changes, rename and delete layouts; switch back to the default layout.</li>
      <li>Restores the layout from the last session when a solution is opened.</li>
      <li>Integrates Rider's Window | Layout Settings into the layout menu (optional).</li>
      <li>Can show the standard layout menu of other JetBrains IDEs instead.</li>
      <li>English and Japanese user interface.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>初回公開版です。</p>
    <ul>
      <li>すべてのソリューションで共通、またはソリューションごとの名前付きツールウィンドウレイアウト。</li>
      <li>レイアウトの復元、変更の保存、名前の変更、削除、デフォルトのレイアウトへの切り替え。</li>
      <li>ソリューションを開くときに、前回終了時のレイアウトを復元。</li>
      <li>Rider の「ウィンドウ | レイアウト設定」をレイアウトメニューに統合 (オプション)。</li>
      <li>他の JetBrains IDE の標準メニューへの切り替え。</li>
      <li>英語と日本語の表示に対応。</li>
    </ul>
    ]]></change-notes>

    <depends>com.intellij.modules.platform</depends>
    <depends>com.intellij.modules.rider</depends>

    <resource-bundle>messages.LayoutManagerBundle</resource-bundle>

    <extensions defaultExtensionNs="com.intellij">
        <applicationConfigurable parentId="tools" instance="jp.lunaproject.layoutmanager.settings.LayoutManagerConfigurable"
                                 id="jp.lunaproject.layoutmanager.settings" key="settings.display.name"/>
        <postStartupActivity implementation="jp.lunaproject.layoutmanager.session.LastSessionRestorer"/>
    </extensions>

    <applicationListeners>
        <listener class="jp.lunaproject.layoutmanager.session.LastSessionRecorder"
                  topic="com.intellij.openapi.project.ProjectCloseListener"/>
    </applicationListeners>

    <actions>
        <action id="LayoutManager.SaveNewLayout" class="jp.lunaproject.layoutmanager.actions.SaveNewLayoutAction"/>
        <action id="LayoutManager.RestoreFactoryDefault" class="jp.lunaproject.layoutmanager.actions.RestoreFactoryDefaultAction"/>
        <!-- Rider's layout scope switches, shown at the end of either layout menu while Rider's Layout Settings is integrated. -->
        <group id="LayoutManager.RiderLayoutScope" class="jp.lunaproject.layoutmanager.actions.RiderLayoutScopeGroup"/>

        <group id="LayoutManager.Layouts" class="jp.lunaproject.layoutmanager.actions.LayoutsActionGroup" popup="true">
            <add-to-group group-id="WindowMenu" anchor="after" relative-to-action="RiderWindowLayoutActions"/>
        </group>

        <!-- The platform's "Layouts" menu, whose actions Rider unregisters (all but RestoreFactoryDefaultLayout,
             which stays registered and is overridden). Same structure and action ids as PlatformActions.xml:
             CustomLayoutsActionGroup looks up "RestoreDefaultLayout" by id. -->
        <group id="LayoutManager.StandardLayouts" class="jp.lunaproject.layoutmanager.actions.StandardLayoutsGroup" popup="true">
            <!-- The platform actions, hidden (also from Find Action) while Layout Manager's menu is chosen. -->
            <action id="RestoreFactoryDefaultLayout" class="jp.lunaproject.layoutmanager.actions.StandardRestoreFactoryDefaultLayoutAction" overrides="true"/>
            <separator/>
            <group id="CustomLayoutsGroup" class="com.intellij.ide.actions.CustomLayoutsActionGroup"/>
            <separator/>
            <!-- Routed by the chosen layout menu so that Shift+F12 restores the active layout of either menu. -->
            <action id="RestoreDefaultLayout" class="jp.lunaproject.layoutmanager.actions.RestoreCurrentLayoutAction"/>
            <action id="StoreDefaultLayout" class="jp.lunaproject.layoutmanager.actions.SaveCurrentLayoutAction">
                <synonym key="action.StoreDefaultLayout.synonym"/>
            </action>
            <action id="StoreNewLayout" class="jp.lunaproject.layoutmanager.actions.StandardStoreNewLayoutAction"/>
            <reference ref="LayoutManager.RiderLayoutScope"/>
            <add-to-group group-id="WindowMenu" anchor="after" relative-to-action="LayoutManager.Layouts"/>
        </group>

        <!-- Rider's Window | Layout Settings, overridden to be hidden while integrated into the layout menu (option in
             Settings | Tools | Layout Manager). Same structure as Rider's definition; the default layout actions are
             wrapped so that they are hidden from Find Action as well. -->
        <action id="RiderStoreDefaultLayout" class="jp.lunaproject.layoutmanager.actions.RiderStoreDefaultLayoutWrapper" overrides="true"/>
        <action id="RiderRestoreDefaultLayout" class="jp.lunaproject.layoutmanager.actions.RiderRestoreDefaultLayoutWrapper" overrides="true"/>
        <group id="RiderWindowLayoutActions" class="jp.lunaproject.layoutmanager.actions.RiderLayoutSettingsGroup" popup="true" overrides="true">
            <reference ref="RiderToolWindowPerIde"/>
            <reference ref="RiderToolWindowPerProject"/>
            <separator/>
            <reference ref="RiderStoreDefaultLayout"/>
            <reference ref="RiderRestoreDefaultLayout"/>
        </group>
    </actions>
</idea-plugin>
